THE SCHEDULE
Paragraph 2
Regulated persons
1. SPH Media Limited.
2.—(1) Any person who holds a broadcasting licence granted under the Broadcasting Act 1994 to provide any of the licensable broadcasting services set out in sub‑paragraph (2), or any entity whose business is regulated by a broadcasting licence granted under that Act to provide the licensable broadcasting services set out in that sub‑paragraph, including a trust.
(2) The licensable broadcasting services for the purposes of sub‑paragraph (1) are the following:
(a)free‑to‑air nationwide television services;
(b)free‑to‑air localised television services;
(c)subscription nationwide television services;
(d)subscription localised television services;
(e)special interest television services;
(f)free‑to‑air nationwide radio services;
(g)free‑to‑air localised radio services;
(h)subscription nationwide radio services;
(i)subscription localised radio services;
(j)special interest radio services;
(k)video‑on‑demand services.
